# ==============================================================================
# CreatorBase Frontend (Next.js) - Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. BACKEND API URL CONFIGURATION
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Development:
# Points to the local Express server running on port 5000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:5000/api"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. VERCEL DEPLOYMENT CONFIGURATION (https://vercel.com)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When deploying the frontend to Vercel:
# 1. Connect your repository and set Root Directory to "frontend".
# 2. Add Environment Variable:
#    Key: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
#    Value: https://your-backend-api.onrender.com/api  (or Railway URL)
# 3. Build Command: npm run build (or automatically detected by Next.js)
# 4. Output Directory: .next (default)
